WEBVTT

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.650
We lost...

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.180
That we did.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.740
What's with you?

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.260
You're acting like this is the end!

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.910
We'll be fine as long as we do even better at the next Idol GrandPrix!

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.600
I wonder what happened to Mega-niisan...

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.200
Now that he's handed Shikyouin-san PriPara,

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.620
what will happen to it?

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>It's because I accepted her challenge back then...</i>

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.880
<i>We'll take you up on it!</i>

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.800
<i>And your arraignment will have to wait until we win!</i>

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:37.140
We don't get to arrest her, either...

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.140
It's vexing-dearu.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.560
My innate power didn't come out, either...

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.920
Don't let it get to you!

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.540
We put everything we had into it!

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.140
That's all we could ask for.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:52.030
It was the best performance we've put on.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:53.460
That's right!

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.240
It was a first-rate performance!

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.400
Don't let yourself get discouraged, President Minami!

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.740
After all, I've been watching over you this whole time!

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.960
PriPara announcement:

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:06.750
Good morning PriPara TV viewers.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:11.970
Our first daily press conference with
Shikyouin Hibiki-sama is about to start.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:13.900
Daily press conference?

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.510
This is Shikyouin Hibiki.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.710
As previously mentioned, starting today,

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:22.970
PriPara is being given a new chance at a dazzling future as CelePara.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:56.590
Let's go! CelePara!

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.030
This is its emblem.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:03.940
CelePara is for celebrities.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:09.210
That is, it's a place where only those who possess both skill and glamour gather.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.580
As such, a new catch phrase befitting that image is necessary.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:17.800
Disparity is Accepted!

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:21.010
Everyone's your rival!
Only celebs are idols!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.190
What's going on?!

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.090
Isn't it "We're all friends! We're all idols"?

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:29.690
As for CelePara, everything has been reset,

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.750
and it's currently undergoing expansive renovations for its revival.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.690
Expansive renovations?!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:38.140
And to grace its reopening ceremonies,

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:41.580
the winners of the Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix,

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.730
namely myself and CelePara Theatre Company,

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:45.410
will be holding their début concert!

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:46.780
That is all.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.770
This has been Shikyouin Hibiki.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.280
Au revoir.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.080
CelePara?

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.680
What's she mean by CelePara?

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.270
There's no way it'll go well.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.380
There's no mention of this in the Aloma Prophesy Grimore-dearu.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.330
She should have done ShabPara for a shabby celebrity.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.180
I'll just have to see what it's like with my own eyes.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.760
That's right!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:09.480
All right!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.830
Let's meet up at PriPara after school is over!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:12.850
Okay, Prez?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.370
Of course!

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.100
I'd like to know how Kuma is doing.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.320
Expansive renovations...

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.890
Last time I only had five minutes in here;

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:31.120
however, thanks to these glasses,
I can stay as long as I want this time.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:42.010
Mission complete.

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:43.990
What's this?

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.970
It doesn't look like anything's changed.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:50.140
So much for CelePara and it's expansive renovations.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.860
As I thought, nothing's chang-

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.110
Wha?!?!

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:06.500
A castle?!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.490
That's... CelePara?

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:15.880
There's no one here-pri.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.680
Where'd everyone go?

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:24.510
Welcome to CelePara.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.230
What is this?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.010
Amazing...

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.650
Please follow me, Nanami-sama.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.390
Kyupiko~n!

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.540
Sakura-sama, Momo-sama,

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.840
may I offer you two a drink?

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.280
Ladies,

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.330
welcome...

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.540
...to CelePara.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.100
We are...

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.120
...your personal escorts.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.380
This way, Dorothy-sama.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.520
I-I'm fine.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:01.790
I can go around on my own.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:02.630
You too, Leona-sama.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.760
S-Sama?!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.610
You as well, Lala-sama.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:05.730
U-Um...

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.620
Mirei-sama, please follow me.

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:08.340
Eh?

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.370
These luxuries are wonderful!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.310
Hibiki-sama has such wonderful taste!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.490
That's for sure!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.230
This is so fun!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:19.730
For the Fairies of the Forest,

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.440
I present this decadent delight,
Panna Cotta with Franboise Sauce.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:25.740
How pretty!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.690
It looks delicious.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.890
Detox-glo.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.620
I was so worried about what PriPara was going to turn into...

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:38.810
...that I ended up forgetting about the small stuff.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.080
It seems like everyone's enjoying themselves.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.650
What's good about detoxing?!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.280
A life without toxins is boring!

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:46.740
Bring on the toxins!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:47.870
Tension max!

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.140
Rela-

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.510
Detox!
Rela-

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:55.220
You know, we can do things on our own,

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.620
so you don't need to follow us!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.310
But...

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.390
She's saying we're fine-pri!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.420
Way to go, Sophie-sama!

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:12.410
Finish up your assignment and come back, Prodigy Team-chanko!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.330
The hill angle is 15-love!

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.540
Lala-chan!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.950
Oh, Eiko-chan!

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.130
Isn't this more like your average amusement park?!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:30.070
Just 'cause you take a kid to an amusement park doesn't mean they'll enjoy it!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.840
But don't you love amusement parks, Dorothy?

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.580
Doth thou plan on following me everywhere?

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:43.350
Just being with Aloma is enough-nano.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.760
Thou aught to understand.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:49.480
We are on different teams until thee hasith thy début concert.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.320
So stop following me around!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.820
Aloma!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.380
Don't run away-nano!

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.040
Look, a ginormous meat bun!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:57.720
Eh?!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.020
Where? Where?! Where?! Where?!?! WHERE?!?!

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.790
There's no way one could fly-dearu!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.460
Ah, Alom-

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:06.420
She ran off-nano...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.700
That's it-nano!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:11.880
Aloma must be so hungry she left Mikan behind-nano.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.090
Over here, please.

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.840
Woah! What's with these chairs?!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.060
They're so soft!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.700
You know, soft chairs are bad for your back.

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.020
This water's fizzing!

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:30.230
It says it's naturally carbonated water from the southern Palps.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.290
Isn't it good for your complexion?

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:34.200
At least that's what they're saying.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.910
The free water is carbonated water-pri?

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:42.640
You learned that carbonated water is made by
injecting water with carbon dioxide in science class!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.120
Hey, someone bring us some normal tap water!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.080
Here you are.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.630
But are you sure about that?

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.700
Yes!

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.300
Ah, so this is where you are.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.140
Aloma!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.760
Where have you been, Aloma?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.970
Excuse me!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:00.680
Two meat buns for Aloma and Mikan, please-nano.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:03.110
We don't sell meat buns.

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:06.580
Instead, we are selling this popular favourite in Hollywood:

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:13.270
a brown sugar and select natural fruity flavoured
Royal Special Gourmet Popcorn in a premium container!

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.110
Meat buns...

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.070
Don't have them!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.990
Everything is going according to plan.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.210
PriPara is all mine.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:29.140
The Spring Dream Idol GrandPrix falls under my responsibility,

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.420
and so does the Dream Parade.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.870
Hibiki-sama.

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.840
Mikan-sama is nowhere to be found.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.530
Oh?

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:38.850
Her again?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.100
We don't have long until our début concert,

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.100
so go find her.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:43.880
Meh.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.370
Actually, I'll go.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:46.910
Meh?

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:50.050
Why don't you take a break and have some sparkling water?

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.570
It'll raise your manliness.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.280
I'm in a good mood today.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.820
Meh.... Hibiki-sama,

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.510
here is Mikan-sama's raising guide.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.280
Oh yeah.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.490
But isn't this a bit much...

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.170
What's with this water?!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.170
What's in it?!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.320
Carbon dioxide.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:21.040
Who drinks this carbonated stuff?!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.870
Don't take a demon for a fool!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.890
Please bring some normal tap water.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.050
In that case, to Leona!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.350
Tension max!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.560
Pleasance!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.020
Ahh, Hibiki-sama!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.090
CelePara is awesome!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.690
Hey.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.950
You girls seem to be enjoying yourselves...

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.410
...here in my new CelePara.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.870
Yes, as you can see, we're having a blast!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.640
Especially with this pompous gas water from wherever.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.450
Bubble water.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:53.300
Carbonated water...

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:55.750
Actually, we're drinking normal tap water.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.220
That's enough, Dorothy.

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:58.850
Rather, it's sad.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:00.430
That's what's in my right hand, too.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:01.700
Is that so?

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:03.580
Seems like you're enjoying yourselves plenty.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:04.380
Huh?

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.890
Anyway,  have you girls seen Mikan?

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.410
Mikan?

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:09.570
Nope.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:10.900
No clue where she is.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.220
I see.

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:13.820
Garçonne!

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:17.900
Get these young ladies another pitcher of normal tap water.

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.320
Yes, ma'am!

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.080
Now then, ladies,

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.420
please continue enjoying CelePara.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.290
Hibiki-sama!

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:39.210
It's lonely without meat buns-nano...

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.680
And there's no Aloma-nano...

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.640
So this is where you are.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.690
Our début concert is taking place soon;

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:50.430
what are you doing here?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.640
Come quickly.

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.490
"If it's a meat bun you want, I have one."

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:10.790
"Let's get five meat buns, so come on, 'kay?"

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.000
Five?!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.290
In that case, let's go-nano!

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.580
These five brand-new idols,

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:20.970
wrapped in a shiny future...

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:24.060
...and summoned by heavenly providence,

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.890
now descend upon the Dream Theatre.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:30.220
Now, let us open a new door,

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.350
and open up the new celebrity world!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.380
We are CelePara Theatre Company!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.820
Oh, their début concert is starting.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.450
We should probably go see it.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.220
Yeah.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:41.400
Probably should.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.410
It's probably rude, but I'm...

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.860
You're not going?

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.090
Then I won't either.

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.200
Lala...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.660
Tis' be no chance of winning if thee not know thine enemy.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.220
She's right.

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:57.630
Besides, there are other things we also need to learn.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:01.980
You're all still motivated-pri?

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:08.880
Won't you scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord?

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:13.270
Only Celebs can scan here.

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:16.320
Coord Change Start!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:23.740
The large plumes that sprout from the waist give off the image of a peacock.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.150
My emblem is embroidered on the back.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:28.030
Escort Cinema Coord!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:34.200
It's quite a passionate red, isn't it?

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.200
See, everyone's eyes are glued to it.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:39.290
Ballroom Cinema Coord!

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.030
Gelrun!

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.250
Go!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.760
Aren't the gems the skirts are studded with dazzling?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.700
Let's put on a concert that will not lose to their radiance.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.760
Ballroom Pearl Coord!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:01.170
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:25.320
Airy Change!

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:32.990
Golden Airy!

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:41.500
Thank you!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:44.000
Everyone's sparkling!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.040
Let's Go!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.590
May you have Heaven's blessing-nano!

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:08.760
Ring the bell of everyone's dreams!

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.950
Aim for a limitless height.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:17.230
Echo, Bell of Revolution!

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:26.840
They're so much better than us.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:29.610
We don't really need to perform any more.

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:32.120
Watching CelePara Theatre Company is good enough for me.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.100
Hibiki-sama is wonderful!

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.230
Pri...

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:36.890
Mirei...

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:39.850
That was great!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.360
CelePara is awesome!

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:43.810
It really is the best!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.820
Want to snap Friend Tickets?

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:50.280
Ah, sorry... but I don't snap with people in different ranks.

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:51.830
Neither do I.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:57.710
Hold on, Friend Tickets have nothing to do with your rank.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:00.490
But in CelePara, disparity is welcome.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:04.210
Celebs should snap with other celebs.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.340
Right?!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.600
Let's go.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:07.890
But...

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:10.170
This is CelePara-pri.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:12.370
Aloma!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.630
Ah!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.460
Aloma found-nano!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:16.590
Mikan...

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.610
Mikan.

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:18.350
Oh my, it's Hibiki-sama!

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.640
Hibiki-sama!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.490
Where are you going?

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:25.270
Now that our début concert is over, the team is disbanding-nano.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.480
No, we're staying together until spring.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.800
Huh?

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:30.440
That's not what you promised-nano!

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:33.150
I make the rules in CelePara.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:37.480
Everyone is happy enough watching just our concert.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:41.370
Besides, there isn't another team that can beat us.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.330
It's pointless to even compete.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.540
In that case, Mikan quits-nano.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.850
Really?

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:50.000
If it's a meat bun you want, I have one.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.680
That's not it.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.120
Being with Aloma is the most important thing to Mikan-nano.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:57.660
The 2nd is also Aloma, as is the 3rd, 4th, 5th, and 6th...

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.970
Each and every one is Aloma...

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:03.190
...all the way to 99th, which is a meat bun-nano!

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:05.990
Hibiki-sama,

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.940
if you lose her, the Autumn Coord ticket...

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:12.920
If this is what you want, I'll give it to you-nano.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:13.860
What?

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:17.040
Mikan and Aloma will be together from here on out-nano!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.140
Even if that means travelling to hell-nano.

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:23.170
In that case, I might also ascend to heaven.

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:24.020
Huh?

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:27.410
If that happens, we might miss each other.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:35.510
Toriko is useless in CelePara as well-tori.

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:39.010
Let Toriko into your group-tori!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.640
Eh?!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.750
A-Are you Mega-nii-tori?

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:49.810
Ah!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.770
Y-You're wrong. You must be mistaken.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.010
Wait-tori!

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:57.620
Talk with Toriko and these bird friends-tori!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.710
He fell all the way into ruin.

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:03.520
Meh.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.270
Well now...

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.370
Back to the drawing board.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.340
But, as long as I have this, it won't be a problem.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.580
The system is under my control.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:23.160
It's time to put the final touches on this revolution.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:23.960
Meh.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.030
Are you...

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.150
Tori!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:41.490
Become one of Toriko's bird friends-tori!

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:43.450
All right!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.910
I'll perform with you whenever you need motivation!
Wai...

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:50.280
It's been a while since the two of us have performed together.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.870
So let's do it!

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:55.640
Mega-neesan in black, I'd like an entry!

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.630
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:00.090
But I'm not in the mood...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.800
Besides, where is Kuma and the others-pri?

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:05.260
Ah, M-Mirei?

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.510
Kuma!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:07.700
Kuma-san?

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:09.260
Usagi-san!
Usagi!

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:12.230
The manager system has been suspended-kuma.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:16.230
And we've been hired as castle attendants-usa.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.830
I used to be an elite manager...

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:20.940
What did you say?!

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:22.700
You're kidding...

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:25.850
Mirei, you must keep performing-kuma!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:28.380
As long as you perform, your future is still wide open-kuma!

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:29.060
Usa!

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:32.370
Even if I've been fired, I'm still your manager in my heart-kuma.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.330
Your entry has been rejected.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.470
Eh?!

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:36.970
Why?

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:38.340
It's the system.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.710
What's going on?

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:18.370
Why can't we perform?!

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:20.690
What's going on with the CelePara System?

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.770
Why has this happened?

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:25.760
If I can't return PriPara to normal, I'll...

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:26.870
Mirei...

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:28.060
Next time:

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:30.170
The End of Idoling-pri.
